  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "• <p>• Set your air fryer to 200°C.<br>• Place spinach falafel in air fryer basket. Lightly coat or spray with olive oil. <br>• Bake until golden and heated through, 5-6 minutes.<br>TIP: No air fryer? Halve spinach falafel. In a large frying pan, heat a generous drizzle <br>of olive oil over medium-high heat. When oil is hot, cook falafels, turning halfway, until <br>golden brown, 4-5 minutes. Transfer to a paper towel-lined plate.</p>",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/697ff119d608bbef6ca0962e/step-55e7ee00.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• <p>• Meanwhile, roughly chop baby cos lettuce (see ingredients).<br>• Halve snacking tomatoes.<br>• Zest lemon, then slice into wedges.<br>• In a small bowl, combine Greek-style yoghurt, lemon zest and a drizzle of <br>olive oil.</p>",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/697ff119d608bbef6ca0962e/step-39c65810.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• <p>• In a large bowl, add cos lettuce, tomatoes, julienned carrot and a drizzle of <br>olive oil and vinegar. Tear in mint leaves and parsley, toss to combine and <br>season to taste with salt and pepper.<br>• Microwave pita bread on a microwave-safe plate until warmed through, <br>1 minute.</p>",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/697ff119d608bbef6ca0962e/step-f783e420.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• <p>• Halve pita bread and spread with garlic sauce.<br>• Fill with some mint salad and falafel, then drizzle with lemon yoghurt.<br>• Divide spinach falafel pita pockets between plates.<br>• Serve with remaining salad and lemon wedges. Enjoy!</p>",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/697ff119d608bbef6ca0962e/step-39c7a630.jpg"
    }
  ]
